cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OMI CTD + SUNA Processing Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Cruise-centric processing, quality control, and calibration pipeline for Sea-Bird CTD casts and
  rosette-mounted SUNA nitrate, with discrete-sample productivity calibration (chlorophyll
  fluorescence against extracted chlorophyll-a; a dormant SBE 43 versus Winkler oxygen path), for
  the Ghana shelf, Gulf of Guinea.
type: software
authors:
